{"about_the_game":"We invite you to play a game with a unique gameplay!  Drone Zone is a combination of tactical shooter and moba games with leveling up. <br>DroneZone is already AVAILABLE IN EARLY ACCESS, click &quot;REQUEST ACCESS&quot;  and you can try to play right now, the game will immediately appear in your library!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.poster.avif?t=1766411187\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.webm?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.mp4?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world is contaminated with hazardous radiation from fallen meteors, that forced humanity to hide under the ground. Your mission is to send various battle drones to the areas exposed to radiation. Survive among anomalies, mutants and fight with other drones for valuable resources contained inside the meteors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/60872c2cb5050964403338aba07d8a43.avif?t=1766411187\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br><br><strong>ACTIVE SKILLS</strong><br><br>Every drone has a number of active skills. You will be able to stun the enemy by a burst of energy, turn on the field that blocks enemy attacks, generate your own anomaly to astonish or distract your opponent and use many other abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/11a3f033b6c8a5a184cf4cfbbdc954b2.poster.avif?t=1766411187\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/11a3f033b6c8a5a184cf4cfbbdc954b2.webm?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/11a3f033b6c8a5a184cf4cfbbdc954b2.mp4?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ASSEMBLE DRONES</strong><br>Use acquired resources to craft engines, guns, batteries and other modules. Assemble your own unique drones using these modules.<br><br><strong>TACTICAL SHOOTER</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/4a50f2495599ee665953f4ae5b0f8f5b.poster.avif?t=1766411187\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/4a50f2495599ee665953f4ae5b0f8f5b.webm?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/4a50f2495599ee665953f4ae5b0f8f5b.mp4?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Destroy any enemy modules, preventing him from using his strengths. For example, destroy engine to make enemy drone fall down or break his gun to deprive him of the ability to shoot.  Don't forget to protect your modules from enemy attacks.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1311560?t=1766411187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1311560?t=1766411187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766411187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766411187","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"We invite you to play a game with a unique gameplay!  Drone Zone is a combination of tactical shooter and moba games with leveling up. <br>DroneZone is already AVAILABLE IN EARLY ACCESS, click &quot;REQUEST ACCESS&quot;  and you can try to play right now, the game will immediately appear in your library!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.poster.avif?t=1766411187\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.webm?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/bed93e50c3e937b78df7ca7bb93e6fdb.mp4?t=1766411187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world is contaminated with hazardous radiation from fallen meteors, that forced humanity to hide under the ground. Your mission is to send various battle drones to the areas exposed to radiation. Survive among anomalies, mutants and fight with other drones for valuable resources contained inside the meteors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311560/extras/60872c2cb5050964403338aba07d8a43.avif?t=1766411187\" width=576 height=324 /></span><br><br><strong>ACTIVE SKILLS</strong><br><br>Every drone has a number of active skills. You will be able to stun the enemy by a burst of energy, turn on the field that blocks enemy attacks, generate your own anomaly to astonish or distract your opponent and use many other abilities.<br><br><s